==German==

===Etymology===
From {{der|de|gml|mutte}}, {{m|gml|motte}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|mot}} and {{cog|en|moth}}, which see for more.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmɔtə/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-Motte.ogg|Audio (Austria)|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|ɔtə|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Motten}}

# [[moth]], any [[nocturnal]] [[butterfly]]
# {{lb|de|specifically}} moth, a member of [[Tineidae]]
# {{lb|de|specifically}} the [[clothing moth]], [[Tineola bisselliella]]

